      "statement": "Strap is a Next.js 16 App Router app backed by one Postgres database (Drizzle, Better Auth, application-level authorization), OpenRouter for inference, GitHub for profile-file sync, and Resend for email; Stripe is retired to a legacy-offboarding-only transport.",
